          "title": "Watch the target",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Keep your recon drone's camera on the target while another team strikes it. The card shows <strong>Eyes on target</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/5e1f49f26467a413.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Say what your drone saw",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>When another team's strike ends where your drone's camera looks, <strong>Missions</strong> asks what you saw. Tap <strong>Destroyed</strong>, <strong>Damaged</strong> or <strong>Miss</strong>, or <strong>Can't tell</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/c55eefdf7e69acf8.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "The striking team sees it",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>The strike's row names the recon that saw it, here <strong>observed by CHARLIE-3</strong> of 2R/1J. <strong>Needs you</strong> still asks the striking team for its own report.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/b88553588c4451d2.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
